      "en": "In queue mode: the **main process** (UI, API, scheduled triggers, dispatching), the **webhook processor** (instances that only receive webhooks — scaled on their own), the **worker** (runs executions), the **bull queue** in Redis linking them, and Postgres holding workflows and run results. Each part scales on its own according to its load."
