      "en": "Redis is a queue here, not a cache: it needs **persistence** (AOF) so jobs survive a restart, enough **redis memory** (jobs are removed when done, but the queue can grow during a rush), and `maxmemory-policy noeviction` — so Redis never deletes jobs when memory fills."
